direction_47 = location "[Imperial Palace Guard] Verca" about "[Imperial Palace Guard] Verca\nJack-of-all-trades who takes care of everything for the Imperial Palace " found "Luferson Castle interior" at 401 1739 in zone 1
direction_545 = location "Hornet" about "Hornet\nReferred to as Hell`s Bees; inhabits plains; powerful venom can kill humans with one sting" found "Karus" karus at 1091 1600 elmorad at 607 991 in zone 1

On available
    Say "Master. [Imperial Palace Guard] Verca is about to go on a hunt, so how about joining him?"
    Topic "Where is he/she?" do
        Map direction_47

On offer
    Say "Ha ha~ I guess it reached your ears as well. Yes, it is true. This time I am going to hunt the Hornets, so do you want to join me?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "You may be able to gain valuable experience from this hunt. Why don't you and your colleagues come join us?\n\nIf you do a favor for [Imperial Guard] Bekar, you will be rewarded with experience points."

On claimable
